{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Over 700 Kanji &amp; 5000 vocabularies</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2728Embark on a Tasty Journey to Master Japanese Kanji! \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kanji Cats</strong> is a beginner-to-advanced kanji learning game that combines the charm of cats, conveyor-belt sushi, and gachapon culture into a fun, interactive learning experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>From Beginner to Advanced\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udcaa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are just starting or already have some experience, Kanji Cats adapts to your level.<br>Enjoy a relaxed beginner mode for stress-free learning, or challenge yourself with the fast-paced advanced mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Tired of apps that lock you into a fixed learning path?\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udc40</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If fixed study paths in other apps never felt right for you, Kanji Cats gives you full control.<br>Customize your kanji and vocabulary list to focus on what you want to learn, review, or reinforce. You can shape your own study plan with filters for <u>topics, JLPT levels, or parts of speech</u> and progress at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/d93a8443b9e88c4b001233aa2763cbbe.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/d93a8443b9e88c4b001233aa2763cbbe.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/d93a8443b9e88c4b001233aa2763cbbe.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/37d424cc1e36590a1d9d0e5fe74831ff.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/37d424cc1e36590a1d9d0e5fe74831ff.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/37d424cc1e36590a1d9d0e5fe74831ff.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pixel-style visuals and short, focused mini-games, Kanji Cats makes studying kanji both fun and rewarding. It\u2019s a great way to start your Japanese journey or to refresh your skills in a colorful world of sushi and cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2b50 Key Features\u00a0\u2b50</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udc08 Cat&amp;Sushi-Inspired Mini-Games\u00a0\ud83c\udf63</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Order Sushi Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Struggle to tell <u>similar-looking kanji</u> apart?</i> Listen to your cat customers\u2019 orders and pick the correct kanji from tricky lookalike options.<strong> </strong>This mode helps you to focus on the details of kanji and spot the differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/312dc914c5daa0ce05a52770f53956e0.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/312dc914c5daa0ce05a52770f53956e0.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/312dc914c5daa0ce05a52770f53956e0.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Order Sushi 2 Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JLPT-inspired, tricky options will try to trip you up! <u>Similar readings and on/kun readings</u> test your focus and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Sushi Box Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Having trouble breaking down <u>kanji structures</u>?</i> Build kanji with <u>radicals</u>!<br>This mode helps you understand how each kanji is built. Great for learners who find kanji breakdowns challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Conveyor Sushi Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type the <u>correct furigana</u> for kanji or vocab as sushi glides past you. A fast, fun way to strengthen your reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Gachapon Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gachapon capsules to unlock tools and earn bonus points in mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc5 Vocabulary Levels from N5 to N3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from JLPT N5 (beginner) to N3 (intermediate) levels and gradually expand your vocabulary. Progress step by step from beginner to intermediate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Customizable Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust speed, difficulty, and focus areas to suit your learning style. Focus on specific kanji or words of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Interactive Audio Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to native pronunciations for each word and connect the sound, meaning, and kanji together for stronger memorization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanji Cats is designed for PC and perfect for learners of all ages. Whether you're just starting or looking to brush up before your next JLPT, get ready to learn Japanese the fun way\u2014with sushi, cats, and kanji!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830490?t=1774252441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830490?t=1774252441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/1aef65f6c53c3f7e3345812336d9d08ba95f7995/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774252441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/1aef65f6c53c3f7e3345812336d9d08ba95f7995/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774252441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":