t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/312dc914c5daa0ce05a52770f53956e0.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/312dc914c5daa0ce05a52770f53956e0.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Order Sushi 2 Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JLPT-inspired, tricky options will try to trip you up! <u>Similar readings and on/kun readings</u> test your focus and knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/b1824216592ba67c8d4fadc2dbb1ae8c.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Sushi Box Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Having trouble breaking down <u>kanji structures</u>?</i> Build kanji with <u>radicals</u>!<br>This mode helps you understand how each kanji is built. Great for learners who find kanji breakdowns challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/2e1d7e1fbbb48a877ca3beec6ea3ed2d.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Conveyor Sushi Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type the <u>correct furigana</u> for kanji or vocab as sushi glides past you. A fast, fun way to strengthen your reading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/484a497d0644f52fd61929803e738fc5.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd38 Gachapon Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gachapon capsules to unlock tools and earn bonus points in mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.poster.avif?t=1774252441\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.webm?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/extras/0b8c4258c4f456399f6368b3c9b4466f.mp4?t=1774252441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc5 Vocabulary Levels from N5 to N3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from JLPT N5 (beginner) to N3 (intermediate) levels and gradually expand your vocabulary. Progress step by step from beginner to intermediate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Customizable Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust speed, difficulty, and focus areas to suit your learning style. Focus on specific kanji or words of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Interactive Audio Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to native pronunciations for each word and connect the sound, meaning, and kanji together for stronger memorization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kanji Cats is designed for PC and perfect for learners of all ages. Whether you're just starting or looking to brush up before your next JLPT, get ready to learn Japanese the fun way\u2014with sushi, cats, and kanji!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["The Farting Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830490/d30ba2534ce1a03adc30082c052acbf46c44a568/header.jpg?t=1774252441","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (1st Gen) or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li>